    "type": "Table",
    "diagnosis": "",
    "title": "<p>Diagnostic criteria for choroid plexus carcinoma</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Cynthia E. Hawkins",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoTableGridLight\" style=\"background: #DAEEF3; border-collapse: collapse; border: none;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 4.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 522.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 4.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"697\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><em>Essential:</em></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 4.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 522.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 4.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"697\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Demonstration of choroid plexus differentiation by histopathological and immunophenotypic features</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 4.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 522.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 4.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"697\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>AND</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 4.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 522.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 4.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"697\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Presence of at least four of the following five histological features:</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Increased cellular density</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Nuclear pleomorphism</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Blurring of the papillary pattern with poorly structured sheets of tumour cells</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Necrotic areas</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Frequent mitoses, usually &gt;&nbsp;2.5 mitoses/mm<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;in a minimum of 2.3&nbsp;mm<sup>2</sup><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt;\">&nbsp;(equating to &gt;&nbsp;5&nbsp;mitoses/10&nbsp;HPF of 0.23&nbsp;mm</span><sup style=\"text-indent: -18pt;\">2</sup><span style=\"text-indent: -18pt;\">)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 4.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 522.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 4.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"697\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>AND</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 4.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 522.8pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 4.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"697\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Intraventricular location</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 4.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 522.8pt; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 4.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"697\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><em>Desirable:</em></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 4.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 522.8pt; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 4.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"697\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>TP53</em> mutation analysis</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 4.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 522.8pt; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 4.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"697\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Methylation profile of choroid plexus carcinoma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 4.0pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 522.8pt; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 4.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"697\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>In select cases:</em> demonstration of hypoploidy by genome-wide chromosomal copy-number analysis</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
